  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. It asks for a modifier key (Shift, Alt, Ctrl and so on) plus the vertical mouse wheel to scroll horizontally across the system. Maintainers are tracking it in PowerToys#25646. Older requests, including #1153 and #39249, were closed as duplicates of it. PowerToys doesn't have this feature yet, and the tickets don't give a release date. Add a thumbs-up and your use cases (Word zoom, Excel columns, photo panning) to #25646 rather than opening a new ticket. In the meantime, many apps already scroll horizontally with Shift + wheel. For apps that ignore it, such as Excel and Word, the tickets say a third-party tool like AutoHotkey is the only workaround."
